{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"edgy-wholesome-cuckoo","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Deploy-window live validation for the f910 mcp-delta fix\n\nThe code fix for `waspy-piecemeal-queenconch` (f910) — teaching `autodeploy.sh`'s mcp delta gate\nto OR `SECRETS_PATHS` via `mcp_delta()` — landed and merged (Gerrit change 2428, merged as\n`b14d05dfc0b0`). Its code-verifiable acceptance criteria (AC1–AC3) are complete and tested.\n\nf910's AC4 is a LIVE ON-BOX observation that inherently cannot be satisfied from a code snapshot\nand could not be run under the read-only-box authoring constraint. It is deferred here so f910\ncan close on its delivered code fix while the operational check is tracked to completion.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] [non-codebase] At the next secrets-only deploy (a commit touching only `SECRETS_PATHS` —\n      `infra/scripts/fetch-secrets.sh` or `infra/terraform/ssm.tf` — with no `MCP_PATHS` path\n      changed), confirm on the prod autodeploy host that a NEW `rebar-mcp` container is built and\n      started, and that its environment carries the newly-emitted value. Record in a comment: the\n      autodeploy journal lines (`compose-build-mcp`, `run --name rebar-mcp-…`), the new container\n      identity/id, and the deploy timestamp.\n      provenance: environment=prod rebar autodeploy host (t4g.large); principal=deploy operator; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — verified by direct operator observation on the live prod box during the next secrets-only deploy; no code artifact can prove a running container's in-memory environment\n\n## Context\n\nRoot cause, precedent (review-bot f600/incident-2731), fix, and RED evidence are on f910 and its\nRCA comment. This ticket exists solely to carry the live post-deploy verification to done.","id":"1d88-7113-4f8e-4e73","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Live-validate mcp secrets-only redeploy at next deploy window (f910 AC4)"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788088436402540165,"uuid":"46dae686-ff23-42e8-8ba5-3c91e30f604b"}